<title>USA: Valspar acquires marine, coatings business.</title>
<headline>Valspar acquires marine, coatings business.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valspar Corp, maker of consumer paints and industrial coatings, said Thursday it purchased technology and inventory of the marine and industrial coatings business of International Zinc, Coatings &amp; Chemical Corp.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The business, with annual sales of about $5 million, will be integrated into Valspar's Marine Coatings division. No facilities were acquired in the transaction.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
